n":"wuzhu-p0030","role":"等并不伏、后乃伏","evidence":["chenghuang-q-4702b76da7565f0c6af2"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chenghuang-q-4702b76da7565f0c6af2"]},"ordering_evidence":"chenghuang-q-4702b76da7565f0c6af2","source_order":[55,107,30],"order":9822},{"id":"chenghuang-e-o064","title":"权破关羽后拜泰汉中太守封陵阳侯卒","accounts":[{"id":"chenghuang-a-ecef9f452ad4a50252bc","label":"正文","text":"权破关羽后拜泰汉中太守封陵阳侯卒","evidence":["chenghuang-q-09b80f490091317a982e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0004","role":"拜汉中太守奋威将军封陵阳侯、黄武中卒","evidence":["chenghuang-q-09b80f490091317a982e"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"破关羽、欲进图蜀者","evidence":["chenghuang-q-09b80f490091317a982e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chenghuang-q-09b80f490091317a982e"]},"ordering_evidence":"chenghuang-q-09b80f490091317a982e","source_order":[55,108,0],"order":9823},{"id":"chenghuang-e-o173","title":"权把泰臂流涕赐御帻青缣盖","accounts":[{"id":"chenghuang-a-4320881a8bdc0abee82f","label":"裴注·江表传","text":"权把泰臂流涕赐御帻青缣盖","evidence":["chenghuang-q-1a0292f91a37bacd4401"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"把其臂流涕交连、字之曰幼平卿为孤兄弟战如熊虎不惜躯命被创数十肤如刻画孤亦何心不待卿以骨肉之恩委卿以兵马之重乎卿吴之功臣孤当与卿同荣辱等休戚幼平意快为之勿以寒门自退也、即敕以己常所用御帻青缣盖赐之、坐罢住驾使泰以兵马导从出鸣鼓角作鼓吹","evidence":["chenghuang-q-1a0292f91a37bacd4401"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0004","role":"被字之、受赐御帻青缣盖、以兵马导从出","evidence":["chenghuang-q-1a0292f91a37bacd4401"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chenghuang-q-1a0292f91a37bacd4401"]},"ordering_evidence":"chenghuang-q-1a0292f91a37bacd4401","source_order":[55,126,11],"related_events":[{"event":"chenghuang-e-o063","type":"related","evidence":["chenghuang-q-1a0292f91a37bacd4401","chenghuang-q-4702b76da7565f0c6af2"],"note":"《江表传》赐周泰御帻青盖与正文问创赐盖叙事相应，两份记载保留原事件定位。"}],"order":9827}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0004","name":"周泰","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o008","chenghuang-q-956cb08068ab0604f15b","chenghuang-q-cee6bd8415ceff101605","chenghuang-q-a688d3b954c339133609","chenghuang-q-1452c144fd62a8bb101b","chenghuang-q-da98e2c12e8dd82f8cfd","chenghuang-q-71118457ea2362bab9bf","chenghuang-q-96f18e49479e01c4162d","chenghuang-q-4702b76da7565f0c6af2","chenghuang-q-09b80f490091317a982e","chenghuang-q-1a0292f91a37bacd4401","chenghuang-q-db64a3fa955823fa8707"],"facts":[{"id":"chenghuang-f-5f3602f7f84956027995","text":"字幼平，九江下蔡人。","evidence":["chenghuang-q-db64a3fa955823fa8707"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wuzhu-m-o008-wuzhu-p0004","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o008"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-p030-wuzhu-p0004","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-p030"]},{"id":"chenghuang-m-6ad91320c9b2eff87b8b","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及周泰","evidence":["chenghuang-q-8ea9b1cd94d25bac351d"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-09b80f490091317a982e","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-7bb0c5956980068d9c6a","layer":"original","quote":"后权破关羽，欲进图蜀；拜泰汉中太守，奋威将军，封陵阳侯。黄武中卒","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":107,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32},{"id":"chenghuang-q-1452c144fd62a8bb101b","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-2b92a0aa789685989e6a","layer":"original","quote":"后从攻皖，及讨江夏。还过豫章，复补宜春长〖7〗：所在皆食其征赋","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":105,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31},{"id":"chenghuang-q-1a0292f91a37bacd4401","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-a85a1dcc86ed8bebe77b","layer":"pei","quote":"权把其臂，因流涕交连，字之曰：‘幼平！卿为孤兄弟，战如熊虎，不惜躯命；被创数十，肤如刻画。孤亦何心不待卿以骨肉之恩，委卿以兵马之重乎！卿，吴之功臣，孤当与卿同荣辱，等休戚。幼平意快为之，勿以寒门自退也！’即敕以己常所用御帻青缣盖，赐之。坐罢，住驾，使泰以兵马导从出，鸣鼓角作鼓吹","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":125,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-fb69de89724421c7381e","start":11,"end":150},{"id":"chenghuang-q-4702b76da7565f0c6af2","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-8c6a419f3b55782dd44f","layer":"original","quote":"时朱然、徐盛等，皆在所部，并不伏也；权特为按行至濡须坞〖11〗，因会诸将，大为酣乐。权自行酒到泰前〖12〗，命泰解衣；权手自指其创痕，问以所起。泰辄记昔战斗处以对，毕，使复服，欢宴极夜。其明日，遣使者授以御盖","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":106,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":30,"end":134},{"id":"chenghuang-q-4899fb2254b87356d5bf","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-c5f772779d9533db571b","layer":"original","quote":"与周瑜为左、右督，破曹公于乌林；又进攻南郡，走曹仁","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":58,"end":83},{"id":"chenghuang-q-5b7906ed2c7bfc57de04","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-c99c878bab695f17a1b1","layer":"original","quote":"权以统为承烈都尉〖12〗。与周瑜等拒破曹公于乌林，遂攻曹仁。迁为校尉","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":270,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34},{"id":"chenghuang-q-71118457ea2362bab9bf","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-2b92a0aa789685989e6a","layer":"original","quote":"后与周瑜、程普拒曹公于赤壁，攻曹仁于南郡。荆州平定，将兵屯岑","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":105,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":42,"end":72},{"id":"chenghuang-q-8ea9b1cd94d25bac351d","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-6ec64dcba52c82713652","layer":"pei","quote":"孙盛曰：“观孙权之养士也，倾心竭思，以求其死力。泣周泰之夷，殉陈武之妾，请吕蒙之命，育凌统之孤：卑曲苦志，如此之勤也！是故虽令德无闻，仁泽（内）〔罔〕著；而能屈强荆吴，僭拟年岁者，抑有由也。然霸王之道，期于大者远者；是以先王建德义之基，恢信顺之宇，制经略之纲，明贵贱之序；易简而其亲可久，体全而其功可大。岂委琐近务，邀利于当年哉！《语》曰：‘虽小道，必有可观者焉，致远恐泥。’其是之谓乎","attribution":"孙盛评论","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":304,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-bca87fa278e46dd5b7c1","start":3,"end":196},{"id":"chenghuang-q-956cb08068ab0604f15b","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-75f9ff64fd58fdbc8556","layer":"original","quote":"与蒋钦随孙策为左右：服事恭敬，数战有功。策入会稽，署别部司马，授兵","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":49},{"id":"chenghuang-q-96f18e49479e01c4162d","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-8c6a419f3b55782dd44f","layer":"original","quote":"曹公出濡须，泰复赴击。曹公退，留督濡须，拜平虏将军","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":106,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25},{"id":"chenghuang-q-9fe204f6acf97427eddb","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-eec0a15bbfd2de6b4e09","layer":"original","quote":"后随周瑜，拒破曹公于乌林。攻曹仁于南郡，未拔","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":226,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22},{"id":"chenghuang-q-a688d3b954c339133609","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-36a7e8afe70fd3664a3e","layer":"original","quote":"策讨六县山贼，权住宣城，使士自卫，不能千人〖3〗。意尚忽略，不治围落〖4〗，而山贼数千人猝至。权始得上马，而贼锋刃，已交于左右，或斫中马鞍。众莫能自定，惟泰奋激〖5〗，投身卫权，胆气倍人；左右由泰，并能就战。贼既解散，身被十二创，良久乃苏。是日无泰，权几危殆；策深德之〖6〗，补春谷长","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":104,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":14,"end":156},{"id":"chenghuang-q-cee6bd8415ceff101605","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-36a7e8afe70fd3664a3e","layer":"original","quote":"权爱其为人，请以自给","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":104,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10},{"id":"chenghuang-q-da98e2c12e8dd82f8cfd","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-2b92a0aa789685989e6a","layer":"original","quote":"从讨黄祖有功","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":105,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":35,"end":41},{"id":"chenghuang-q-db64a3fa955823fa8707","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-75f9ff64fd58fdbc8556","layer":"original","quote":"周泰字幼平，九江下蔡人也〖1〗。","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16},{"id":"meng-context","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-c5dafa5a24682c296ffa","quote":"从征黄祖，祖令都督陈就，逆以水军出战。蒙勒前锋〖15〗，亲枭就首；将士乘胜，进攻其城。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":316,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":43},{"id":"meng-identity","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-09ad3b8bc938115b5986","quote":"吕蒙字子明，汝南富陂人也〖1〗。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":312,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16},{"id":"meng-wulin","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-c5dafa5a24682c296ffa","quote":"是岁，又与周瑜、程普等，西破曹公于乌林，围曹仁于南郡。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":316,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":91,"end":118},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o008b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7adf6fb487c32ced7646","layer":"original","quote":"使吕范平鄱阳（会稽）〖22〗，程普讨乐安〖23〗；太史慈领海昏〖24〗，韩当、周泰、吕蒙等，为剧县令、长〖25〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":20,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":38,"end":95},{"id":"wuzhu-e-p030a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-56fc0fcff99b4d647260","layer":"pei","quote":"近得守将周泰、全琮等白事：过月六日，有马步七百，径到横江，又督将马和，复将四百人进到居巢；琮等闻有兵马渡江，视之，为兵马所击；临时交锋，大相杀伤。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":347,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-43467797fb37569f4074","start":41,"end":114},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o008","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7adf6fb487c32ced7646","layer":"original","quote":"八年〖20〗，权西伐黄祖，破其舟军，惟城未克；而山寇复动〖21〗，还过豫章，使吕范平鄱阳（会稽）〖22〗，程普讨乐安〖23〗；太史慈领海昏〖24〗，韩当、周泰、吕蒙等，为剧县令、长〖25〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":20,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":95},{"id":"wuzhu-q-p030","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-56fc0fcff99b4d647260","layer":"pei","quote":"又曰：‘先王以权推诚已验，军当引还；故除合肥之守，著南北之信：令权长驱，不复后顾。近得守将周泰、全琮等白事：过月六日，有马步七百，径到横江，又督将马和，复将四百人进到居巢；琮等闻有兵马渡江，视之，为兵马所击；临时交锋，大相杀伤。猝得此问，情用恐惧。权实在远，不预闻知；约敕无素，敢谢其罪？又闻张征东、朱横海，今复还合肥。先王盟要，由来未久；且权自度，未获罪衅，不审今者何以发起，牵军远次？事业未讫，甫当为国讨除贼备；重闻斯问，深使失图！凡远人所恃，在于明信；愿殿下克卒前分，开示坦然；使权誓命，得卒本规。凡所愿言，周等所当传也。’","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":347,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-43467797fb37569f4074","start":0,"end":265},{"id":"xunyu-q-b-ee371e4d38e13efa88cd","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-ee371e4d38e13efa88cd","layer":"modern","quote":"〖4〗八年：建安八年（公元 203）。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-89fa02f36b1a0d0955da","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"xunyu-q-o023","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-64b6e45c68fb16b80ee9","layer":"original","quote":"太祖复次于河上，绍病死。太祖渡河，击绍子谭、尚。而高幹、郭援侵略河东，关右震动。钟繇帅马腾等，击破之，语在《繇传》。八年〖4〗，太祖录彧前后功，表封彧为万岁亭侯。﹝一﹞","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":84}],"profiles":{"wuzhu-p0004":{"fields":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0004-directory-courtesy","key":"courtesy","label":"字","text":"幼平","evidence":["chenghuang-q-db64a3fa955823fa8707"]}],"directory":{"faction":"wu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
